   "subject": "add median/mean to violin/boxplot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi all!\r<br>This is my first post on ggplot2.\r<br>\r<br>I am trying to add the mean to a violin/boxplot graphic. When I have\r<br>only one factor it is working fine but when I have two factors the\r<br>mean of each factor appears only in the middle (not in the box or\r<br>violin plots). I played with alpha and width with no luck. My second\r<br>problem is that the boxplots are not inside the violin plots.\r<br>\r<br>Any help would be really appreciated.\r<br>martin\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>library(ggplot2)\r<br>library(scales)\r<br>library(plyr)\r<br>\r<br>A reproductible example (data=test in the code below):\r<br>\r<br>structure(list(Site = structure(c(1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L,\r<br>1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L,\r<br>2L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L), .Label =\r<br>c(&quot;Site1&quot;,\r<br>&quot;Site2&quot;, &quot;Site3&quot;), class = &quot;factor&quot;), Treatment = structure(c(1L,\r<br>1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L,\r<br>1L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 2L, 2L, 2L,\r<br>2L, 2L, 2L), .Label = c(&quot;Control&quot;, &quot;test&quot;), class = &quot;factor&quot;),\r<br>    Value = c(4L, 3L, 11L, 22L, 6L, 7L, 3L, 9L, 6L, 10L, 20L,\r<br>    30L, 40L, 2L, 4L, 5L, 8L, 10L, 21L, 30L, 2L, 5L, 8L, 10L,\r<br>    3L, 4L, 5L, 6L, 7L, 8L, 22L, 21L, 20L, 14L, 5L, 3L)), .Names =\r<br>c(&quot;Site&quot;,\r<br>&quot;Treatment&quot;, &quot;Value&quot;), class = &quot;data.frame&quot;, row.names = c(NA,\r<br>-36L))\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>My code:\r<br>ggplot(test, aes(Site, Value)) + geom_violin(aes(fill=Treatment))\r<br>+ geom_boxplot (aes(fill=Treatment), alpha=1, width=0.5) + ylim(0,50)\r<br>+ opts(legend.position=c(0.1,0.7)) + opts(axis.title.x =\r<br>theme_blank())\r<br>+ stat_summary(aes(group=Treatment), fun.y=mean, geo=&quot;point&quot;,\r<br>fill=&quot;black&quot;, shape=21, size=3)"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "10boY4e0szQJ",
   "from": "David Kahle",
   "author": "e4aec126ff1dca22",
   "date": "2012-03-27T01:15:43Z",
   "subject": "Re: add median/mean to violin/boxplot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">I think this is a rigged version of what you want, I&#39;m sure Winston will have a better solution :<div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">ggplot(aes(</span>x <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>Site<span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> y <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>Value<span style=\"color:#052499\">), </span>data <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>test<span style=\"color:#052499\">)</span> <span style=\"color:#052499\">+</span> </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>geom_violin(aes(<span style=\"color:#000000\">fill</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">Treatment</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">alpha </span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">.25</span>) +</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">  geom_boxplot<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>(aes(<span style=\"color:#000000\">fill</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">Treatment</span>),<span style=\"color:#000000\"> alpha</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">.25</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> width</span>=<span style=\"color:#065218\">0.5</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">position </span>= position_dodge(<span style=\"color:#000000\">width </span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">.9</span>)) +<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\">  <span style=\"color:#052499\">stat_summary(aes(</span>group<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span>Treatment<span style=\"color:#052499\">),</span> fun.y<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span>mean<span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> geom<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0140f\">&quot;point&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">    </span>fill<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0140f\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> shape<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">21</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> size<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">3</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">, </span>position <span style=\"color:#052499\">= position_dodge(</span>width <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>.9<span style=\"color:#052499\">))</span> <span style=\"color:#052499\">+</span> </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>ylim(<span style=\"color:#065218\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#065218\">50</span>) +<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>opts(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">    </span>legend.position<span style=\"color:#052499\">=c(</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">),</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">    <span style=\"color:#000000\">axis.title.x </span>= theme_blank()</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">  )</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">Strangely,  the following doesn&#39;t work (it only moves one of the groups, and not both).  It may be a bug...</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Helvetica\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\">w <span style=\"color:#052499\">&lt;- </span>.2</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">ggplot(aes(</span>x <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>Site<span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> y <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>Value<span style=\"color:#052499\">), </span>data <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>test<span style=\"color:#052499\">)</span> <span style=\"color:#052499\">+</span> </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>geom_violin(aes(<span style=\"color:#000000\">fill</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">Treatment</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">alpha </span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">.25</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">position </span>= position_dodge(<span style=\"color:#000000\">width </span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">w</span>)) +</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">  geom_boxplot<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>(aes(<span style=\"color:#000000\">fill</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">Treatment</span>),<span style=\"color:#000000\"> alpha</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">.25</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> width</span>=<span style=\"color:#065218\">0.5</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">position </span>= position_dodge(<span style=\"color:#000000\">width </span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">w</span>)) +<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\">  <span style=\"color:#052499\">stat_summary(aes(</span>group<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span>Treatment<span style=\"color:#052499\">),</span> fun.y<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span>mean<span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> geom<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0140f\">&quot;point&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">    </span>fill<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0140f\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> shape<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">21</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span> size<span style=\"color:#052499\">=</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">3</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">, </span>position <span style=\"color:#052499\">= position_dodge(</span>width <span style=\"color:#052499\">= </span>w<span style=\"color:#052499\">))</span> <span style=\"color:#052499\">+</span> </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>ylim(<span style=\"color:#065218\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#065218\">50</span>) +<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">  </span>opts(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#052499\">    </span>legend.position<span style=\"color:#052499\">=c(</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">,</span><span style=\"color:#065218\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#052499\">),</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">    <span style=\"color:#000000\">axis.title.x </span>= theme_blank()</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\">  )</div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#052499;min-height:19.0px\">    </p></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">You can probably get what you want from there.</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">Cheers</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">david.</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 14px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(5,36,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\"><br></span></div><div></div></div></div>"
